  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        429.6968688964844,
        25.911376953125,
        469.82733154296875,
        35.63787841796875
      ],
      "text": "Reading\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.2269287109375,
        61.53948974609375,
        129.08905029296875,
        71.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "Questions 37-40\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.2269287109375,
        87.45086669921875,
        226.59494018554688,
        100.41949462890625
      ],
      "text": "Choose the correct letter,\nA,B, C or D.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.2269287109375,
        114.08203125,
        334.79644775390625,
        124.88922119140625
      ],
      "text": "Write the correct letter in boxes 37-40 on your answer sheet.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        38.507171630859375,
        139.99334716796875,
        312.98779296875,
        150.4403076171875
      ],
      "text": "37.\nWhat is Mott T Greene doing in the fifth paragraph?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        62.25927734375,
        159.7867431640625,
        318.803466796875,
        170.9542236328125
      ],
      "text": "A\ndescribing what motivated him to write the book\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        62.979034423828125,
        172.742431640625,
        340.7561340332031,
        183.909912109375
      ],
      "text": "B_\nexplaining why it is desirable to read the whole book\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        62.979034423828125,
        185.69815063476562,
        379.96868896484375,
        196.8656005859375
      ],
      "text": "C\nsuggesting why Wegener pursued so many different careers\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        63.33892822265625,
        198.65386962890625,
        385.02130126953125,
        209.8212890625
      ],
      "text": "D\nindicating what aspects of Wegener’s life interested him most\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        38.867095947265625,
        219.88677978515625,
        315.57904052734375,
        231.05422973632812
      ],
      "text": "38\nWhat is said about Wegener in the sixth paragraph?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        62.97906494140625,
        240.39993286132812,
        296.75726318359375,
        251.2071533203125
      ],
      "text": "A\nHe was nota\nparticularly ambitious person.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        63.698822021484375,
        253.35565185546875,
        324.7270812988281,
        264.5230712890625
      ],
      "text": "B-\nHekepta\nrecord of all his scientific observations.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        63.698822021484375,
        265.951416015625,
        377.94622802734375,
        277.4790954589844
      ],
      "text": "C_\nHe did not adopt many of the scientific practices of the time.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        63.698822021484375,
        279.2669982910156,
        380.2423095703125,
        290.4344482421875
      ],
      "text": "D\nHe enjoyed discussing new discoveries with other scientists.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.58685302734375,
        301.9394226074219,
        421.6139831542969,
        346.5764465332031
      ],
      "text": "39\nWhat does Greene say about some other famous scientists?\nA __ Their published works had a greater impact than Wegener’s did.\nB_\nThey had fewer doubts about their scientific ideas than Wegener did.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        64.0587158203125,
        348.00408935546875,
        390.39801025390625,
        358.4510498046875
      ],
      "text": "C\nTheir scientific ideas were more controversial than Wegener’s.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        64.0587158203125,
        361.3196716308594,
        350.7822265625,
        372.4870910644531
      ],
      "text": "D_\nThey are easier subjects to write about than Wegener.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.22698974609375,
        384.35198974609375,
        313.6357421875,
        417.1151123046875
      ],
      "text": "40\nWhat is Greene’s main point in the final paragraph?\nA__\nItis not enough in life to have good intentions.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        64.41860961914062,
        417.4609680175781,
        346.85247802734375,
        428.62841796875
      ],
      "text": "B_\nPeople need to plan carefully if they want to succeed.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        64.0587158203125,
        430.4166564941406,
        367.138916015625,
        441.5840759277344
      ],
      "text": "C_\nPeople have little control over many aspects of their lives.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        64.41860961914062,
        443.012451171875,
        393.2771301269531,
        454.5401306152344
      ],
      "text": "D__Itis important that people ensure they have the freedom to act.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        380.0334777832031,
        661.0997924804688,
        473.1272888183594,
